WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.712
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.712 --> 00:00:06.686
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:06.686 --> 00:00:10.186
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:10.186 --> 00:00:10.516
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:10.516 --> 00:00:11.547
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.547 --> 00:00:15.210
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:15.221 --> 00:00:18.522
Choose a 100-point question about tokens.

00:00:18.522 --> 00:00:22.100
Reveal the expected answer before self-scoring.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.077
Self-score the first response as correct: +100.

00:00:27.077 --> 00:00:32.107
Open a 200-point training question.

00:00:32.107 --> 00:00:35.673
Reveal the chapter-based training answer.

00:00:35.673 --> 00:00:40.663
Mark this answer incorrect; the score stays at 100.

00:00:40.663 --> 00:00:45.612
Choose a 300-point inference question.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:51.608
Reveal the inference explanation.

00:00:51.608 --> 00:00:57.088
Award 300 points and inspect the updated total.

00:00:57.088 --> 00:01:04.316
Reset the board for another round.
